<title>COLOMBIA: Banco de Bogota nine-month profits soar.</title>
<headline>Banco de Bogota nine-month profits soar.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Banco de Bogota reported the following accumulated results for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>Net profit 101.7 billion pesos, compared with 57.3 billion over the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Operating income 84.5 billion pesos compared with 62.1 billion.</p>
<p>-- Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
